!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions

# An agent's per-machine tool permissions. Nothing about this repository: it
# records which shell commands one person's assistant may run without asking,
# and it arrived here because a `git add -A` swept it up. The shared form,
# .claude/settings.json, is not excluded — that one would be a decision about
# the project rather than about a laptop.
.claude/settings.local.json
